{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd7724391efc7ff3c3666c4b3f62f2876039dcdc8cbc3c07c348890080600181", "ja": "（海美達の出演した映画は、無事にクランクアップ！\n最後、現場は温かい拍手に包まれた……）", "zh": "（海美她们在拍的电影顺利杀青了！\n拍摄现场的最后充满了温暖的掌声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "94ad03962105873525795b70beec6b647f7c3a2af6f791b500a6e6324515b872", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまっ！\nラストシーンは白熱したね！　いい汗かいた～♪", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n最后一幕真是热血呢！流了满身汗，真过瘾～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ffe068445b5fd274188b6cd068ea5115e4cf1d6c36f8954f14b94a4663560d3a", "ja": "お疲れさま、海美！　うん、手に汗握るシーンだった。\n正直、海美があんなにやれるとは思わなかったよ。", "zh": "海美，辛苦了！嗯，确实是叫人看得紧张的一幕。\n老实说，我很意外海美居然这么厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "07b8c344d2ede3a773cf2ce73515214389f7811f3c9a8aaffa177e9a28688868", "ja": "も～、そんなに褒められると照れちゃうよ？\nでもうれしいな……えへ、えへへ♪", "zh": "哎唷～你这么夸我，我会害羞的！\n不过我很高兴……嘿嘿、嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b56e038949530d994cf5b599d634bf4f9312abcd5796497bbe63987c1a5b9f68", "ja": "この仕事で、海美の新しい面も見せられたと思う。\n今から映画の公開が楽しみだな。", "zh": "我觉得自己透过这份工作见识到海美新的一面。\n我已经在期待电影的上映了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "98efe773bc43d5c39b1559121ee711b41cd958854d88728aafcd728eb15bb4a8", "ja": "うんうん、そうだよね！　私も楽しみだもん！\n絶対にヒットさせたいな～。", "zh": "嗯嗯，就是说啊！我也很期待呢！\n无论如何都想看到电影卖座啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "00461d2925020234bd659cf5698b028f034e16cb70bbbf834a5b2e2db5e40a53", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。もしヒットしたら、\n海外でも公開されたりするのかな！？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}，要是电影爆红，\n会不会也在国外上映啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3c76d987711b72f7922339a4e2995f8bcca7b19593ee8165f2b7ab71faf2f40a", "ja": "そうだな、そういう可能性もあるかも……\nせっかくだから、それくらい大ヒットしてほしいな！", "zh": "我想想，也是有这个可能……\n难得拍电影，希望电影能卖座到那个地步呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "ab3960cbdab70943388949deff8d9c50cf719b88641dca186b929b4b14a45bc2", "ja": "うん！　……それとね？　もし海外でもやったら、\nお姉ちゃんが観に来てくれるかも～って！", "zh": "嗯！还有呀，要是在国外上映，\n说不定姊姊会来看呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "a61e255bb6dec34e6c0bd543c40a3c27760f06bdf8f1573df43c783ac9b09b56", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、たまに日本に帰ってくるんだけど。\n映画と、タイミングが合うかどうかわからないし……。", "zh": "姊姊虽然偶尔会回日本，\n但也不晓得能否赶上电影上映的期间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "9501e21ff4f2cd46dbc96e164effdd534d9eeaaff27283ac661d691d286d9ee7", "ja": "でもでも、せっかくだから！　お姉ちゃんにも、\n大きなスクリーンに映った私を、見てもらいたいーっ！", "zh": "可是可是，既然都拍了！\n我想让姊姊也能看到大银幕上的自己──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8f6fe2bf44822dbd723a43d6a4016017e6125b103269e1826dd8797351077809", "ja": "うん……そうだな！　じゃあ、俺も映画を\n大ヒットさせるために、営業活動頑張るよ。", "zh": "嗯……说得对！\n那我也要努力去宣传，让电影卖座起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "c2e66d1885ffc7c7217a4a50444cd8ea57333fa5375a5091c60f81859c68b00e", "ja": "ありがとう、{$P$}！\nうんうん、やっぱり頼りになるね！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！\n嗯嗯，你果然很可靠呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "a1a481129f8602da5259dd802522cadfa54fbcfb7c313e8f7b3ae76bf32aa004", "ja": "じゃあ、がんばりついでに……\nもうひとつだけ、私のお願い聞いてもらえるかな？", "zh": "那，除了努力之外……\n我还有个请求，你愿意听听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1014_p", "source_sha256": "de45084e4f5c13026123031e336ad8e25343ecec0037e58023b9d847e6962b98", "ja": "お願い？", "zh": "请求？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "ca0105141ec1544a4e21611c902940143172923e3b1a931d8c488c9ef969e85e", "ja": "うんっ！　撮影も無事終わったから、\n今からみんなと海で遊びたいなーって☆", "zh": "嗯！电影既然都杀青了，\n我现在想跟大家去海边玩～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "e117e5f8d6bca3103b8aec3e27e3629ee14f718b9e1613efad4b95bf468b0e21", "ja": "せっかく目の前に海があって、水着も着てるんだし。\n遊ばないなんて、もったいないでしょ？", "zh": "难得眼前就有海，我们也穿着泳装，\n不去玩一下岂不是很可惜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ad66f8117b656604c3fb1c74ea098704e164593302a540f2081b2e330f721b0b", "ja": "そんな事か……まぁ、大丈夫じゃないかな？\n監督に許可をもらってくるよ。", "zh": "原来是这种事啊……我想应该没问题，\n我去跟导演说一声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "ddf9ec98de254c52eeb9b8922562a8e62b7ebb6350ae74cfdf60d79ddfe7078a", "ja": "やった、ありがとー！　じゃあ、みんなを呼んでくる！\n{$P$}も、泳ぐ準備しておいてね♪", "zh": "太好了，谢谢你──！那我去叫大家过来！\n{$P$}也要做好游泳的准备喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0083_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c80dceb497be19d3dca5475605bca84d612676630a78b047599fb42d76d4104a", "ja": "え？　いや、俺は水着を持ってきてないし海には……\nおーい、海美ー！？", "zh": "咦？不用啦，我也没带泳装来，没办法……\n喂──海美──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
